WEBVTT

00:06.800 --> 00:07.600
Protect Your Majesty

00:07.680 --> 00:08.320
Protect Your Majesty

00:08.440 --> 00:09.760
Your Majesty

00:09.840 --> 00:11.240
Your Majesty

00:12.760 --> 00:13.600
Your Majesty

00:13.680 --> 00:14.520
Your Majesty

00:14.600 --> 00:16.000
Your Majesty

00:22.500 --> 00:32.500
In the twenty-sixth year of Longwu, the Xuan army annihilated Shi Lang's forces in the Battle of Tiannan Pass. Shi Lang himself met his end at Dama Mountain—a clash commemorated in history as the 'Battle of Tiannan Pass'.

00:35.280 --> 00:36.040
Quack doctors

00:36.120 --> 00:36.880
They're all quacks

00:36.960 --> 00:38.520
Drag them all out and behead them

00:38.600 --> 00:39.840
General, spare us

00:39.920 --> 00:41.560
General, please spare us

00:42.120 --> 00:43.920
Your Majesty's injury has reached the internal organs

00:44.000 --> 00:46.400
Coupled with years of managing state affairs

00:46.720 --> 00:48.120
And recent continuous battles

00:48.520 --> 00:51.640
Now Your Majesty's body is exhausted

00:52.000 --> 00:54.960
We truly are powerless

00:57.120 --> 00:58.520
Forget it

01:00.640 --> 01:02.240
Don't trouble them

01:03.280 --> 01:04.680
Your Majesty

01:05.680 --> 01:06.720
Your Majesty

01:06.800 --> 01:08.200
Find someone

01:09.280 --> 01:10.960
Keep them under guard

01:12.440 --> 01:14.280
No one may contact them

01:15.560 --> 01:16.920
Yes

01:17.000 --> 01:18.400
Also

01:18.480 --> 01:19.880
From now on

01:20.480 --> 01:22.040
Without my permission

01:23.800 --> 01:25.200
Anyone

01:25.480 --> 01:27.120
May not approach the tent

01:27.640 --> 01:29.000
Within ten zhang

01:32.640 --> 01:34.480
What if the two generals come to request an audience?

01:34.560 --> 01:35.920
You say

01:37.000 --> 01:38.400
I

01:38.960 --> 01:40.600
Am exhausted from marching

01:42.040 --> 01:43.440
Everything

01:43.560 --> 01:45.893
Will be discussed upon return to court

01:46.520 --> 01:47.920
Now

01:48.320 --> 01:49.987
The central plains are settled

01:50.960 --> 01:52.440
Shilang is dead

01:53.240 --> 01:54.640
Our dynasty

01:56.040 --> 01:58.760
Has no more worries

02:00.480 --> 02:02.040
Soldiers

02:04.520 --> 02:06.920
Should go home

02:08.600 --> 02:10.760
First month of the 27th year of Longwu

02:10.840 --> 02:12.080
You issue an edict

02:12.160 --> 02:15.720
Ordering the Second Prince Sikong Xu to continue guarding Yan Bei

02:15.800 --> 02:18.320
The rest of the army returns to court

02:18.400 --> 02:20.040
When reaching the Shuoyang County area

02:20.120 --> 02:21.960
The weather became increasingly cold

02:22.320 --> 02:24.987
You had to rest temporarily in Yiyang City

02:35.160 --> 02:36.560
Your Majesty

02:36.800 --> 02:38.080
The weather is too cold

02:38.160 --> 02:39.827
Not suitable for long outings

02:40.000 --> 02:41.400
Your health is important

02:42.240 --> 02:43.640
Have they all arrived?

02:44.200 --> 02:45.600
Yes

02:45.680 --> 02:46.960
The people you wish to summon

02:47.040 --> 02:49.707
Are all in the city awaiting your order

02:50.240 --> 02:51.560
Good

02:51.640 --> 02:53.040
Good

02:55.120 --> 02:56.720
At this time, the city lord's residence

02:56.800 --> 02:59.280
Has been converted into your temporary residence

03:00.120 --> 03:03.040
All your affairs are managed here

03:04.160 --> 03:05.440
Years of warfare

03:05.520 --> 03:09.000
Your hair has actually shown some silver

03:10.640 --> 03:12.040
Though physically weak

03:12.320 --> 03:15.520
Your eyes still shine with light

03:17.760 --> 03:20.093
You know your time is running out

03:20.320 --> 03:22.200
But the newly pacified realm

03:22.440 --> 03:25.440
Cannot fall into chaos again because of your departure

03:25.640 --> 03:29.680
You must handle everything that follows

03:38.720 --> 03:40.120
Your Majesty

03:55.560 --> 03:56.960
Issue orders

